### IntelliJ IDEA ###
# Ignored wholesale: everything IDEA writes here is machine-local (SDK paths, Gradle
# home, module lists that go stale). To share team settings, un-ignore narrowly, e.g.
# !.idea/codeStyles/ or !.idea/inspectionProfiles/.
.idea/
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr
out/
!**/src/main/**/out/
!**/src/test/**/out/

